{"3474620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EXONAUTIS", "steam_appid": 3474620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exonautis is an underwater sci-fi survival game set on an oceanic exoplanet. Dropped into a vast alien open world with nothing but your wreckage and S.A.L.T to guide your, you must make your way to Kappa Outpost and begin your exploration of the Calliope 4348A.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/d129f4c5d93b2f16a07a0d4340553b97.avif?t=1781392629\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras_big/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629 width=800 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an Expansive Alien Ocean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is home to many biodiverse ecological systems brimming with vibrant but equally dangerous fauna. Every biome in Sector Alpha is different, from lush and sunny coral reefs, to deep and dark ravines and caverns, you need to learn about how each zone works in order to survive and dive deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/4c84469889f4f923d91248aa82f8041d.avif?t=1781392629\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras_big/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629 width=800 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, Explore and Upgrade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After crashlanding on Calliope 4348A, you will need to find water, food, make yourself warm and most importantly, manage your oxygen. Scavenge the ocean floor for resources, craft supplies and tools such as a scanner, sampler and gun. Upgrade your equipment in order to explore deeper, more dangerous areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/2f23182c5d0488df43beeb82b78b538f.avif?t=1781392629\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras_big/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629 width=800 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Mysteries of Sector Alpha</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After having crashlanded in Sector Alpha and barely surviving, you must head to Outpost Kappa. However, things get even stranger when you discover everyone disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/a4db1fb00377170a2bce027beedccdce.avif?t=1781392629\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras_big/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629 width=800 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot Advanced Vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture further into the ocean you will need to construct various vehicles to help you travel the ocean expanse and dive to deeper depths. Pilot the Horizon Racer, an agile hoverbike that allows you to traverse both ocean and land at vast speeds, or the Neptune Explorer, a one man submersible that vastly increases your underwater exploration capabilities, and upgrade them to further push the boundaries of your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/e0affa8e19bb7e5eaf4e0e006362e341.avif?t=1781392629\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras_big/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629 width=800 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct Underwater Bases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving on an alien planet is not easy and you will soon need to construct your own base. Luckily, the builder tools allow you to easily do that. Choose different layout modules and components and design your custom habitat, a safe point where you can store and replenish your supplies. Inside your base, you can build various farming modules to grow your own crops and build a self-sustaining system, greatly increasing your survival capacity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/9d228d2b3cf49677638a56e7c752290b.avif?t=1781392629\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras_big/29daa2174852b597de00522021f0c5e3.webp?t=1781392629 width=800 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Depths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slowly you will start to make your way deeper and deeper into the ocean. The shallow, sun drenched starting areas will give way to vast underwater plateaus, and deep descents into the lower plateaus, more than a thousand meters below the surface. As you traverse these vast dark oceanic expanses, you will encounter a seemingly bottomless trench filled with horrors but also the answers that you seek. Will you brave the dark depths and uncover the secrets of the planet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/5f818cd4964cb7f93fc828eecd7443f9.avif?t=1781392629\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exonautis is an underwater sci-fi survival game set on an oceanic exoplanet. Dropped into a vast alien open world with nothing but your wreckage and S.A.L.T to guide your, you must make your way to Kappa Outpost and begin your exploration of the Calliope 4348A.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/d129f4c5d93b2f16a07a0d4340553b97.avif?t=1781392629\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/2