y bottomless trench filled with horrors but also the answers that you seek. Will you brave the dark depths and uncover the secrets of the planet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/extras/5f818cd4964cb7f93fc828eecd7443f9.avif?t=1781392629\" width=800 height=158 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Crashlanded on Calliope 4348A, your objective is to navigate the vast oceanic biomes, survive and construct your vehicles and bases to dive deeper and uncover the mysteries behind the disappearance of the Kappa crew.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/4baf5f2cd6d7abc72368a8e4a00f89da9c6a29fd/header.jpg?t=1781392629", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/e3f876de6fd84ed6f0c36474ae0815f96edd118f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781392629", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474620/e3f876de6fd84ed6f0c36474ae0815f96edd118f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781392629", "website": "https://baleycstudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-14600K or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong>